{"id":"n67867-1-8","stage":2,"title":"욕실 · 浴室","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67867-1-8-1","ko":"욕실 청소는 이번에 누구 차례지?","zh":"这次该谁打扫浴室呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"욕실","meaning":"浴室","explanation":"욕실：浴室","readings":[{"term":"욕실","audio":"/audio/ae6de37fe8809c8f7754.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67867","senseId":"1","lemma":"욕실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청소는","meaning":"打扫，清扫，扫除","explanation":"청소：打扫，清扫，扫除；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"청소","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32789","senseId":"1","lemma":"청소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차례지?","meaning":"顺序，次序","explanation":"차례：顺序，次序；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"차례","audio":"/audio/e9fa78157c623c88645e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62410","senseId":"2","lemma":"차례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ae6de37fe8809c8f","term":"욕실","zh":"浴室","audio":"/audio/ae6de37fe8809c8f7754.mp3","entryId":"67867","definition":"配有供洗澡的设施的房间。","pronunciation":["욕씰"]},{"id":"8049e4b9139d36bf","term":"청소","zh":"打扫，清扫，扫除","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3","entryId":"32789","definition":"清除肮脏杂乱的东西。","pronunciation":["청소"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"e9fa78157c623c88","term":"차례","zh":"顺序，次序","audio":"/audio/e9fa78157c623c88645e.mp3","entryId":"62410","definition":"按照做事情或事情发生的顺序所得到的机会。","pronunciation":["차례"]}],"audio":"/audio/774eee9def54c363f411.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67867-1-8-2","ko":"내가 지난주에 했으니까 이번에는 너야.","zh":"我上周已经打扫过了，所以这次该你做。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지난주에","meaning":"上周","explanation":"지난주：上周；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난주","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58105","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했으니까","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번에는","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너야.","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7d3f1e161caf0a72","term":"지난주","zh":"上周","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3","entryId":"58105","definition":"本周的前一周。","pronunciation":["지난주"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]}],"audio":"/audio/b15d0584c1f5edfa1a87.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.858,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67867","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":64,"sequenceScore":1.5833,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次该谁打扫浴室呢？","我上周已经打扫过了，所以这次该你做。","你们俩是彼此不认识的人对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次该谁打扫浴室呢？","我上周已经打扫过了，所以这次该你做。","你们俩是彼此不认识的人对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
